      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "The value of the hides, tanned and untanned, imported into the United Kingdom in 1874 (chiefly from America, British India, and Australia) was 6,531,432*l.*, as against 6,700,661*l.* in 1873, and 3,309,263*l.* in 1860. IMPORTATION AND EXPORTATION [J. R. McCulloch, Dictionary of Commerce and Commercial Navigation (1880), scan p. 1709]",
