      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "a product obtained from coal-tar, the base of many beautiful dyes. These are numerous, there are black, blue, green, purple, violet, and yellow anilines; also rosaniline, fuchsine or magenta, azuline, etc.: see **COAL TAR DYES**. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 440]",
