      "oe:isAggregate": false,
      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "projecting knobs to fasten boots, articles of dress, &c. They are made of various substances; metal, pearl, shell, horn, bone, wood, glass, silk, porcelain, &c. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 69]",
