      "oe:sitcCode": "oe:sitcUnassigned",
      "oe:isAggregate": false,
      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "*cubeba of the shops*, (GER. *Kubeben*. DU. *Koebeben*. DA. *Cubeber*. SW. *Kobeber*, *Cobeber*. FR. *Cubebes*. IT. *Cubebi*. SP. *Cubebas*. PORT. *Cobebas*. RUS. *Kubebii*. POL. *Kubeby*. LAT. *Cubebae*,) a small dried fruit resembling a grain of pepper, but somewhat longer; brought into Europe from the island of Java. [Thomas Mortimer (rev. Dickinson), A General Commercial Dictionary (1823), scan p. 257]",
        "@language": "en"
      },
      "oe:dictionarySource": [
