      "oe:isAggregate": false,
      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "a small open or decked vessel, usually propelled by oars. There are numerous kinds of boats, the construction and names of which differ, according to the service required of them; they will be found described in their alphabetical order. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 55]",
