      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "a fine red volatile colouring matter, in the form of crystals, found in madder, and which yields the Turkey-red dye. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 20]",
        "@language": "en"
