      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "*Linn.*; *Fl. Br. Ind.*, vi., 405-6; Gamble, *Man. Ind. Timbs.*, 726; Talbot, *List. Trees, etc.*, 1902, 339; *Rec. Bot. Surv. Ind.*, ii., 347; *Agri. Ledg.*, 1900, No. 4; 1901, No. 8; Mollison, *Textbook Ind. Agri.*, iii., 256-62; Mukerji, *Handbook Ind. Agri.*, 433-5; PALMÆ. **D.E.P.**, i., 291-301. **Betel-nut Palm.** **Habitat.**—So much might be written regarding this nut  [Sir George Watt, The Commercial Products of India (1908), scan p. 95]",
