        "@value": "116–20, 521, 546, 627, 705, 812, 1005, 1046, 1074. *Bassora* Gums, 78, 95. *Pastaj*, 174; *Basunti*, 25; *Báswesa*, 538; *Bat*, 54; *Batata*, 1028; *Batávi-nebu*, 324; *Batbar*, 538; *Batha-bijir*, 465; *Bathiec*, 317; *Báthu*, 63, 257; *Bathu-sag*, 293; *Batiec indi*, *battikh*, 317. *Batiste d'ananas*, 69. *Bat-meka* (Bustard), 140; *Battari*, 1032; *Batti* (Lac Sticks), 1063 [Sir George Watt, The Commercial Products of India (1908), scan p. 1161]",
