        "@value": "a metallic powder resembling gold-dust. The principal uses of bronze colours are for japanning and bronzing tin and iron goods, statues, castings, paper machine work, printing, ornamental painting, and such like purposes. *See LEAF METAL.* [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 64]",
