        "@value": "*R. Br.*; and **C. procera**, *R. Br.*; *Fl. Br. Ind.*, iv., 17; Wight, *Illust. Ind. Bot.*, ii., t. 155, 156A; also *Ec.*, t. 1278; Gamble, *Man. Ind. Timbs.*, 491; Cooke, *Fl. Pres. Bomb.*, ii., 151; ASCLEPIADEÆ—the Swallow-worts. D.E.P., ii., 33-49. Madar. **Habitat.**—The two species indicated above are so nearly the same from the practical standpoint that they may here be  [Sir George Watt, The Commercial Products of India (1908), scan p. 217]",
