        "@value": "an esteemed medicinal root obtained in eastern Africa from the *Cocculus palmatus* of Linnæus, the *Menispermum palmatum* of others, and which is a most valuable antiseptic and tonic. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 111]",
