      },
      "skos:scopeNote": {
        "@value": "Document-attested minor 19th-century commodity absent as a standalone line in Layer-1 British/Canadian customs ledgers; typically subsumed under htc:0012 (Seeds, Nuts & Kernels for Oil Unenumerated). Attested in: P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 119, P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Products of the Vegetable Kingdom (1854, Project Gutenberg #15191).",
