        "@value": "The expressed oil from the seeds of the *Croton tiglium*, a small tree growing in Hindostan, Ceylon, and the Moluccas, and belonging to the Natural Order *Euphorbiaceæ*. [J. R. McCulloch, Dictionary of Commerce and Commercial Navigation (1880), scan p. 555]",
