      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "a name for the Angostura bark, obtained from *Galipea Cusparia*, a tree of South America, which is powerfully aromatic and stimulant, and is esteemed for its useful medicinal properties. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 130]",
