      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "a valuable timber of Siam, obtained from the *Metrosideros vera*; a wood used in ship-building, as when submerged it is superior to teak. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 483]",
