      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "is the Indian name of the nutritious matter of the shrub _jatropha manihot_, from which _cassava_ and _tapioca_ are made in the West Indies. [Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (Project Gutenberg #44562)]",
