      "oe:sitcCode": "SITC4_29_Crude_Animal_Vegetable_Materials",
      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "any thing applied to fertilize land. In this and some European countries where the soil has been much exhausted by repeated cropping, a large trade is carried on in natural and artificial manures. Several of these, as guano, super-phosphate of lime, &c, are noticed under their separate heads. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 251]",
        "@language": "en"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": {
