      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "a choice and valuable white resin obtained from the *Pistacia lentiscus*, which forms the basis of a varnish for paper; a building cement made from Portland stone, sand, and a small quantity of litharge. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 254]",
