      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "the bark of *Daphne Mezereum*, which is employed medicinally, having acrid, laxative, and poisonous qualities. It is also used as a masti-catory. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 259]",
