      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "(GER. *Nika-* *ragaholz, Blutholz.* DU. *Bloodhout.* DA. *Blodtræ.* SW. *Blodtrü.* FR. *Bois de sang, Bois de Nicaragua.* IT. *Legno sanguigno.* SP. *Palo de sangre.* PORT. *Pao sanguinho,*) a kind of dye-wood, of a very bright red colour; brought from Nicaragua, a province of Spanish America, where the tree which produces it grows in great abundance. NICKEL, a semi-metal, whic [Thomas Mortimer (rev. Dickinson), A General Commercial Dictionary (1823), scan p. 673]",
