        "@value": "Document-attested minor 19th-century commodity absent as a standalone line in Layer-1 British/Canadian customs ledgers; typically subsumed under htc:0054 (Dye Stuffs & Dye Woods Unenumerated). Attested in: 1866 British Customs Commodities List (Danika / HGIS Lab), Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (Project Gutenberg #44562).",
