        "@value": "an esteemed edible mollusc, the *Ostrea edulis*, largely consumed in cities. About 300,000 bushels a year are sold in London. There are various species of edible oysters found in different seas. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 282]",
