      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "Annexed is a statement of the value of the exports from this port in the three years ending with 1872-3:— Statement of the Quantities and Value of the principal Articles of Export from Pernambuco in 1872-3. There entered this port in 1872-3, 1,410 foreign and 1,309 coasting vessels; the tonnage of the former being 894,924, and of the latter 545,991 tons, and the departures were [J. R. McCulloch, Dictionary of Commerce and Commercial Navigation (1880), scan p. 1747]",
