      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "a light-veined brown-wood, the produce of *Cordia Gerascanthus*, obtained in Jamaica, and principally used for turning. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 314]",
