      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "(_Fard_, Fr.) The only cosmetic which can be applied without injury to brighten a lady’s complexion, is that prepared, by the following process, from safflower (_Carthamus tinctorius_). [Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (Project Gutenberg #44562)]",
