      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "868. *San-tág*, 430; *Santagu*, 976. **SANTALUM ALBUM**, see Sandal-wood. *Santaniká*, 470; *Santara* (Citrus aurantium), 320-4; ... *nibu* (Sweet Lime), 326-7; *Sante kayi*, 439; *Santh*, 402; *Santha* (Woodfordia), 1121; *Sánthi* (Rice), 834; *Santi*, 1072. **Santonica**, santonin, 93. **Santra** (Cyperus rotundus), 466. *Sanubar-el-hindi*, 292; *Sanu-kapashi*, 1; *Sanvu*, 43 [Sir George Watt, The Commercial Products of India (1908), scan p. 1193]",
        "@language": "en"
