      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "a dye-wood obtained in Malabar, and the islands of the Eastern seas, from the *Cesalpinia sappan*, *C. coriaria*, and *pulcherrima*. A decoction of the wood is used by calico-printers for red dyes. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 340]",
