      },
      "skos:scopeNote": {
        "@value": "Document-attested minor 19th-century commodity absent as a standalone line in Layer-1 British/Canadian customs ledgers; typically subsumed under htc:0054 (Dye Stuffs & Dye Woods Unenumerated). Attested in: Danika Drugs.xlsx (British Pharmacopoeia 1867 / Savory 1865), Danika Drugs.xlsx (SKOS Sheet), 1866 British Customs Commodities List (Danika / HGIS Lab), P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 340, Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (Project Gutenberg #44562).",
