      "oe:sitcCode": "oe:sitcUnassigned",
      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "one of the alkaline earths, of which _strontium_ is the metallic basis, occurs in a crystalline state, as a carbonate, in the lead mines of Strontian in Argyleshire, whence its name. [Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (Project Gutenberg #44562)]",
