      "oe:sitcCode": "oe:sitcUnassigned",
      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "Linn.; *Fl. Br. Ind.*, iv., 90; Kirtikar, in *Journ. Bomb. Nat. Hist. Soc.*, 1893, viii., 331-4 and t.; Gamble, *Man. Ind. Timbs.*, 497-8; Talbot, *List Trees, etc.*, 1902, 241-2; Prain, *Beng. Plants*, 1903, ii., 704; Cooke, *Fl. Pres. Bomb.*, 1904, ii., 185; LOGANIACEÆ. The Snake-wood, Nux-vomica or Strychnine Tree, *kuchlá*, *kajra*, *nirmal*, *kerra*, *mushti*, *yetti*, *ka [Sir George Watt, The Commercial Products of India (1908), scan p. 1063]",
        "@language": "en"
      },
