      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "is a rare metal, first discovered by Klaproth, in the black mineral called _pechblende_, found in a mine near Johann-Georgen-Stadt, in Saxony, and which is a sulphuret of uranium. [Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (Project Gutenberg #44562)]",
