      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "the bisulphuret of mercury in powder, a delicate bright red colour, which is pale or deep. The Chinese vermilion is sold in packets. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 412]",
