        "@value": "another name for the ghitton, a wild animal, the *Gulo Arcticus*, of whose skins about 1,000 are annually imported for furriers' use from North America. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 427]",
